  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "5 bedroom, 3000+ sq. ft home, with amazing Gulf views, and beach access located right out the back door featuring high end finishes and amenities. This home has over 700 sq. feet of porches, with spacious outdoor living and dining areas, including a large gas grill on the 2nd floor overlooking the Gulf. The gourmet kitchen is complete with a 48\" Thermador gas range, huge island and two separate dishwashers. There are two separate living room areas and two complete master suites with king beds. The 3rd floor master suite has its own private kitchenette and balcony overlooking the Gulf with a swinging bed. There are also 2 cozy Queen suites. The kids will love the bunk room, complete with 6 bunks, individual charging stations for electronics, a TV, and separate living area. The Summer's Edge neighborhood has two community pools, both very close-by Tall Cotton has parking for up to (4) four cars. This house is centrally located south of 30A in Seagrove Beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
